ext match page's form)</td><td>fewer matches: fewer pills</td></tr><tr><td>&ldquo;Bayern M&uuml;nchen won 4 and drew 1 of their last 5 matches &hellip;&rdquo;</td><td>the same rows, counted per team; the names: the header's (block 2)</td><td>each split has its own wording (&ldquo;won all 5&rdquo;, &ldquo;won 2, drew 2 and lost 1&rdquo;)</td></tr><tr><td>up to 19 Sept 2026</td><td>the later of the two teams' latest <code>played_kickoff_datetime</code> in the window</td><td>&ndash;</td></tr></table><div class="mk-gap">Gap 1. The sentence's wordings in German and Finnish, generated in the export as #145 sets for sentences.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 2. When the page turns into the next match page: when its round is the next one (<code>mart_competition_fixtures</code>' <code>is_next_round</code>), served today.</div></div><section class="mk-p mk-chg" aria-label="Form"><div class="sechead"><span class="eyebrow">Form</span><span class="mk-n">9</span></div><p class="tt-intro"><span class="nb">Bayern München</span> won 4 and drew 1 of their last <span class="nb">5 matches</span> in all competitions up to <span class="nb">19 Sept 2026</span>; <span class="nb">Borussia Dortmund</span> won all 5.</p><div class="mk-formhead"><div class="mk-fh home"><div class="h">Bayern München</div><div class="pills"><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill D">D</span><span class="pill W">W</span></div></div><div class="mk-fh away"><div class="h">Borussia Dortmund</div><div class="pills"><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span><span class="pill W">W</span></div></div></div></section> <div class="mk-src"><b>Data</b><table><tr><th>On the page</th><th>Comes from</th><th>When it is missing</th></tr><tr><td>Recent matches &middot; the team names</td><td>site text; <code>mart_competition_fixtures.home_team_name</code>, <code>.away_team_name</code></td><td>a name: not guaranteed (block 1, gap 1)</td></tr><tr><td>which matches, newest first</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window</code>, the same window as the form block, ordered by <code>recency_rank</code></td><td>fewer matches: fewer rows; none: no rows</td></tr><tr><td>W &middot; D &middot; L</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window.result</code></td><td>never missing: tested never empty, W/D/L only</td></tr><tr><td>1&ndash;0</td><td><code>.goals_for</code>, <code>.goals_against</code>, from the team's side</td><td>not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr><tr><td>VfB Stuttgart &middot; A</td><td><code>.opponent_name</code>; <code>.home_away</code></td><td>a name: not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr><tr><td>Bundesliga &middot; 19 Sept</td><td><code>.played_league_code</code>, named by <code>mart_competition_index.competition_name</code>; <code>.played_kickoff_datetime</code>, its UTC day until #146</td><td>not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr></table><div class="mk-gap">Gap 1. The window mart tests the result, the order and the opponent's key, but not the opponent's name, the goals, the date or the competition: a row can render with a blank.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 2. The built row cuts long names off with &ldquo;&hellip;&rdquo; at every width (&ldquo;TSG 1899 Hoffenheim&rdquo;, &ldquo;L&uuml;neburger SK Hansa&rdquo;), shows competition codes, and its W/D/L and H/A letters are English on the German and Finnish pages.</div></div><div class="mk-b"><section aria-label="Recent matches"> <div class="sechead"> <span class="eyebrow">Recent matches</span>  </div> <div class="split"> <div> <div class="colhead">Bayern München</div> <div class="rmatch"> <span class="res W">W</span> <span class="rscore">7–0</span> <span class="ropp">1. FC Union Berlin<span class="ha">H</span></span> <span class="rmeta">BL1 · 18 Sept</span> </div><div class="rmatch"> <span class="res W">W</span> <span class="rscore">2–1</span> <span class="ropp">SV Elversberg<span class="ha">A</span></span> <span class="rmeta">BL