eam's first match in a league, <code>mart_team_season_record</code> (<code>window_type</code> prev_season)</td><td>neither served: the block says there are no matches yet</td></tr><tr><td>the 16 values, while a league runs</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum</code>, up to the last 5 finished matches in all the club's competitions this season: <code>goals_per_match</code>, <code>goals_against_per_match</code>, <code>clean_sheets</code>, <code>shots_per_match</code>, <code>shots_inside_box_pct</code>, <code>shots_on_goal_per_match</code>, <code>finishing_efficiency_pct</code>, <code>passes_per_match</code>, <code>passes_accuracy_pct</code>, <code>passes_key_per_match</code>, <code>duels_per_match</code>, <code>duels_won_pct</code>, <code>defensive_actions_per_match</code>, <code>saves_pct</code>, <code>corners_per_match</code>, <code>corners_against_per_match</code></td><td>one side missing: &ldquo;&ndash;&rdquo; on that side; both missing: the row is left out</td></tr><tr><td>the 16 values, before a team's first match in a league</td><td><code>mart_team_season_record</code>, the same columns, last season in this league (<code>window_type</code> prev_season)</td><td>as above</td></tr><tr><td>the link &ldquo;What the metrics mean&rdquo;</td><td>the glossary page: not built, its address a placeholder, its definitions not written yet (the catalogue's <code>description</code> is technical and English only)</td><td>until the page exists, nothing links</td></tr><tr><td>Discipline: yellow cards, red cards</td><td>nothing serves them for the window: the catalogue's <code>cards_yellow</code>, <code>cards_red</code> are season totals, and <code>mart_team_momentum</code> has no card columns</td><td>shown as &ldquo;&ndash;&rdquo; until served (gap 5)</td></tr><tr><td>the five W/D/L pills, newest first</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window.result</code>, ordered by <code>recency_rank</code>; read from the final score, so a win after extra time is W and a match settled on penalties 