><code>mart_team_momentum_window</code>, the same window as the form block, ordered by <code>recency_rank</code></td><td>fewer matches: fewer rows; none: no rows</td></tr><tr><td>W &middot; D &middot; L</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window.result</code></td><td>never missing: tested never empty, W/D/L only</td></tr><tr><td>1&ndash;0</td><td><code>.goals_for</code>, <code>.goals_against</code>, from the team's side</td><td>not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr><tr><td>VfB Stuttgart &middot; A</td><td><code>.opponent_name</code>; <code>.home_away</code></td><td>a name: not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr><tr><td>Bundesliga &middot; 19 Sept</td><td><code>.played_league_code</code>, named by <code>mart_competition_index.competition_name</code>; <code>.played_kickoff_datetime</code>, its UTC day until #146</td><td>not guaranteed (gap 1)</td></tr></table><div class="mk-gap">Gap 1. The window mart tests the result, the order and the opponent's key, but not the opponent's name, the goals, the date or the competition: a row can render with a blank.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 2. The built row cuts long names off with &ldquo;&hellip;&rdquo; at every width (&ldquo;TSG 1899 Hoffenheim&rdquo;, &ldquo;L&uuml;neburger SK Hansa&rdquo;), shows competition codes, and its W/D/L and H/A letters are English on the German and Finnish pages.</div></div><div class="mk-b"><section aria-label="Recent matches"> <div class="sechead"> <span class="eyebrow">Recent matches</span>  </div> <div class="split"> <div> <div class="colhead">Borussia Dortmund</div> <div class="rmatch"> <span class="res W">W</span> <span class="rscore">1–0</span> <span class="ropp">VfB Stuttgart<span class="ha">A</span></span> <span class="rmeta">BL1 · 19 Sept</span> </div><div class="rmatch"> <span class="res W">W</span> <span class="rscore">3–0</span> <span class="ropp">SC Paderborn 07<span class="ha">H</span></span> <span class="rmeta">BL1 · 12 Sept</span> </div><div class="rmatch"> <span class="res W">W</span> <span class="