hing_efficiency_pct</code>, <code>passes_per_match</code>, <code>passes_accuracy_pct</code>, <code>passes_key_per_match</code>, <code>duels_per_match</code>, <code>duels_won_pct</code>, <code>defensive_actions_per_match</code>, <code>saves_pct</code>, <code>corners_per_match</code>, <code>corners_against_per_match</code></td><td>one side missing: &ldquo;&ndash;&rdquo; on that side; both missing: the row is left out</td></tr><tr><td>Possession</td><td>each team&rsquo;s share of the passes in its window matches (its passes over both teams&rsquo;), the catalogue&rsquo;s new Possession. Not served yet; the mock reads a stand-in read once</td><td>&ndash; when a match in the window lacks either team&rsquo;s passes</td></tr><tr><td>the 16 values, before a team's first match in a league</td><td><code>mart_team_season_record</code>, the same columns, last season in this league (<code>window_type</code> prev_season)</td><td>as above</td></tr><tr><td>the link &ldquo;What the metrics mean&rdquo;</td><td>the glossary page: not built, its address a placeholder, its definitions not written yet (the catalogue's <code>description</code> is technical and English only)</td><td>until the page exists, nothing links</td></tr><tr><td>Discipline: fouls, yellow cards, red cards, per match</td><td>each team&rsquo;s window matches&rsquo; team stat lines (a blank card on a line with statistics is 0). Not served yet: the Form comparison&rsquo;s mart gains fouls and the cards per match with the catalogue change; the mock reads a stand-in read once</td><td>as every rate: &ndash; when a match in the window has no stat line</td></tr><tr><td>the five W/D/L pills, newest first</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window.result</code>, ordered by <code>recency_rank</code>; read from the final score, so a win after extra time is W and a match settled on penalties is D</td><td>fewer than five: fewer pills</td></tr><tr><td>incl. DFB-Pokal, UEFA Champions League</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum.contributing_c