hing_efficiency_pct</code>, <code>passes_per_match</code>, <code>passes_accuracy_pct</code>, <code>passes_key_per_match</code>, <code>duels_per_match</code>, <code>duels_won_pct</code>, <code>defensive_actions_per_match</code>, <code>saves_pct</code>, <code>corners_per_match</code>, <code>corners_against_per_match</code></td><td>one side missing: &ldquo;&ndash;&rdquo; on that side; both missing: the row is left out</td></tr><tr><td>Possession</td><td>each team&rsquo;s share of the passes in its window matches (its passes over both teams&rsquo;), the catalogue&rsquo;s new Possession. Not served yet; the mock reads a stand-in read once</td><td>&ndash; when a match in the window lacks either team&rsquo;s passes</td></tr><tr><td>Shots on goal against</td><td>the opponents&rsquo; shots on goal per match over the window, the catalogue&rsquo;s <code>shots_on_goal_against_per_match</code> (a Rankings board over the season). Not served for the window yet; the mock reads a stand-in read once</td><td>as every rate</td></tr><tr><td>the 16 values, before a team's first match in a league</td><td><code>mart_team_season_record</code>, the same columns, last season in this league (<code>window_type</code> prev_season)</td><td>as above</td></tr><tr><td>the link &ldquo;What the metrics mean&rdquo;</td><td>the glossary page: not built, its address a placeholder, its definitions not written yet (the catalogue's <code>description</code> is technical and English only)</td><td>until the page exists, nothing links</td></tr><tr><td>Discipline: fouls, yellow cards, red cards, per match</td><td>each team&rsquo;s window matches&rsquo; team stat lines (a blank card on a line with statistics is 0). Not served yet: the Form comparison&rsquo;s mart gains fouls and the cards per match with the catalogue change; the mock reads a stand-in read once</td><td>as every rate: &ndash; when a match in the window has no stat line</td></tr><tr><td>the five W/D/L pills, newest first</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum_window.result</code>, ordered by <code>recency_rank</code>; read from the final score, so a win after extra time is W and a match settled on penalties is D</td><td>fewer than five: fewer pills</td></tr><tr><td>incl. DFB-Pokal, UEFA Champions League</td><td><code>mart_team_momentum.contributing_competitions</code>, named by <code>mart_competition_index.competition_name</code></td><td>own competition only: no &ldquo;incl.&rdquo; part</td></tr></table><div class="mk-gap">Gap 1. None of the 16 value columns has a not-null test; 11 of them have only a not-negative test, no upper bound (the 5 percentages are held to 0&ndash;1, clean sheets to 0&ndash;games).</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 2. The page picks between two marts by phase; the choice is a rule of the matrix, so one mart should serve each side's window for the match, with its <code>window_type</code>, and the page only show it.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 3. The Last 5 caption shows competition codes (&ldquo;DFBP, UCL&rdquo;); the W/D/L letters are English on the German and Finnish pages (the site says S/U/N and V/T/H elsewhere); the Defending sub-label is English in all three.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 4. Every value is rounded in the browser (<code>format.ts</code>); rounding in the browser is the defect #108 names.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 5. Discipline needs each team's yellow and red cards over its window: <code>mart_team_momentum</code> gains them from <code>int_legs__team_match</code>, the source the season totals already use, withheld when a match in the window has no statistics line.</div></div><section aria-label="Form comparison"> <div class="sechead"> <span class="eyebrow">Form comparison</span>  </div><p class="tt-intro mk-p mk-chg">Form metrics from each team&rsquo;s last 5 matches across all competitions. <a class="mk-chevlink" href="/en/glossary/">Metric Glossary<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="current