yer's line says 0), then has no reader on the site and retires with the matchstats export this page replaces. A window of one is not &ldquo;momentum&rdquo;: the mart's name is yours at the build.</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 2. The defect found in block 3: <code>int_legs__team_match</code> credits own goals to the wrong side and counts the shoot-out's kicks as penalty goals, so % Goals per shot on goal is wrong in every match with an own goal or a shoot-out, here and in the Form comparison (the leg gives 17% and 75% for this match).</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 3. Rounding: the stand-in rounds; the served values should come rounded from the warehouse (#108).</div><div class="mk-gap">Gap 4. Free kicks: the provider does not say what it counts; it matches free kicks won (Dortmund&rsquo;s 13 are Hoffenheim&rsquo;s 13 fouls), and it is sent on only 54 of 72 Bundesliga team lines this season.</div></div><section class="mk-p mk-chg" aria-label="Match stats"><div class="sechead"><span class="eyebrow">Match stats</span><span class="mk-n">4</span></div><p class="tt-intro">Each team&rsquo;s numbers in this match. <a class="mk-chevlink" href="/en/glossary/">Metric Glossary<svg class="chev" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></p><div class="win win-w1"><div class="cmp"><div class="mk-formhead"><div class="mk-fh home"><div class="h">TSG 1899 Hoffenheim</div></div><div class="mk-fh away"><div class="h">Borussia Dortmund</div></div></div><div class="mgroup">Shooting</div><div class="mrow"> <div class="mval home better">18</div> <div class="mmid"> <div class="mlabel">Shots</div> <div class="mbar" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="bside home"> <span class="fill better" style="width:100%"></span> </div> <div class="bside away"> <span class="fill" style="width:61%"></span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="mval away">11</div> </